Drop your Koi deployment artifacts here (these are gitignored and never committed):

  Koi.msi      - Windows Service installer  (Settings -> Deployment -> Installed)
  mdm.ps1      - Agentless script package   (Settings -> Deployment -> Agentless -> Download)

Both come from your Cortex AES deployment portal with your customer_id / slug.
This repo deliberately does NOT contain them.
